` key?\r\n\r\nThere are other key codes for numpad (space, tab, f1-f4) as well that we aren't handling at all:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/xkbcommon/libxkbcommon/blob/b5cde5c1b5ca744d1934dac992010604852be6df/include/xkbcommon/xkbcommon-keysyms.h#L291-L297\r\n\r\nBut these are probably not remapped like `Enter`, so should not be here.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2637127160/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2637191810","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102448#issuecomment-2637191810","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102448","id":2637191810,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6dMFqC","user":{"login":"adamscott","id":270928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MDkyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270928?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott","html_url":"https://github.com/adamscott","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-05T15:15:16Z","updated_at":"2025-02-05T15:15:16Z","body":"I agree with @bruvzg, I will remove Enter.\r\n\r\nHere's a [document from the USB consortium](https://www.usb.org/sites/default/files/documents/hut1_12v2.pdf).\r\n\r\n![Capture d’écran du 2025-02-05 10-13-33](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/57d0a336-1cc4-4d13-8d5d-d3580f4337b4)\r\n\r\nThe equal key seems to be for a Macintosh-era keyboard (like really old, not about modern Macs), which aren't used anymore.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2637191810/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2637217593","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102448#issuecomment-2637217593","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102448","id":2637217593,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6dML85","user":{"login":"adamscott","id":270928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MDkyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270928?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott","html_url":"https://github.com/adamscott","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-05T15:18:32Z","updated_at":"2025-02-05T15:18:32Z","body":"> The equal key seems to be for a Macintosh-era keyboard (like really old, not about modern Macs), which aren't used anymore.\r\n\r\nFunnily enough, I have a Macintosh LC II at home.\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>Here's the = key</summary>\r\n\r\n![PXL_20250205_151556957](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/56b10fe8-4d2a-4976-8a91-2d5906768a21)\r\n\r\n</details>","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2637217593/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2637220708","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102448#issuecomment-2637220708","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102448","id":2637220708,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6dMMtk","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-05T15:19:29Z","updated_at":"2025-02-05T15:21:17Z","body":"> The equal key seems to be for a Macintosh-era keyboard\r\n\r\nFor the reference: my keyboard have `=` printed on the numpad `Enter`, but it seems to always act as `Enter` regardless of numlock state (`XKB_KEY_KP_Enter`), so not sure when it's used (maybe in some layouts), Enter/Tab/Space/Fx should not be in list, but `Equal` probably should, since it implies remapping (even if nothing really use it).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2637220708/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2637230683","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102448#issuecomment-2637230683","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102448","id":2637230683,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6dMPJb","user":{"login":"adamscott","id":270928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MDkyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270928?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott","html_url":"https://github.com/adamscott","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-05T15:22:48Z","updated_at":"2025-02-05T15:22:48Z","body":"> I agree with @bruvzg, I will remove Enter.\r\n> \r\n> Here's a [document from the USB consor